; Slow 1200mV 0C Model Hold: 'MIPI_PIXEL_CLK'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ;
+--------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+----------------+----------------+--------------+------------+------------+
